Mark Healey wrote:

> Warning: cannot write scoreboard file record

> I obviously have some permissions or directories set incorrectly.  What
> should I look at?

Consider playing a game as the superuser, who should be
able to write that file (its literal name is "record"), then quit
the game and do a find() for "record" newer than yesterday.
That will tell you where "record" is supposed to be written.

Then, as superuser, go down the path of directories to the
directory containing "record" and make sure they all have
appropriate write/execute permissions.

